    "title": "Mister Car Wash",
    "description": "Experience your favorite membership in a different way. The Mister Car Wash app offers a quick and convenient way to join the Unlimited Wash Club, buy a wash, and manage your membership on the go. \r\n\r\nWith the Mister Car Wash app, you can: \r\n\r\n    \u2022 Join our Unlimited Wash Club or link a membership you purchased at a Mister location \r\n    \u2022 Manage your memberships \r\n    \u2022 Update payment information \r\n    \u2022 View or print transaction and wash history \r\n    \u2022 Buy a single wash \r\n    \u2022 Find a Mister near you and save your favorites \r\n    \u2022 Subscribe and stay in the loop with exclusive news and offerings",
